# `apps/dashboard` is a separate Next.js app with its own toolchain and its own
# `.eslintrc.json` (see apps/dashboard/README.md). It is linted by
# `yarn lint:dashboard`, not by `yarn test:code`: the root run resolves a
# different eslint-plugin-import version than `next lint` does, and the two
# disagree on where `import type` belongs, so a file cannot satisfy both.
